@namespace PoPunkouterSoftware.Client

@* The build stamp, YYMMDD, pinned to the lower-right corner of every page (estate standard,
   2026-11-17). It used to be an in-flow footer under the page body reading
   "PoPunkouterSoftware · v1.0.0+<sha>", so on any page taller than the window it was
   off-screen, and it never carried a date at all. The value comes from the BuildVersion
   assembly metadata (see the client csproj and Services/Ui/BuildStamp.cs). Decoration with
   pointer-events: none so it can never sit on top of a tap target. *@
<footer class="app-build-version" aria-label="Application build version">
    <span title="Build @BuildStamp.Value">v@(BuildStamp.Value)</span>
</footer>
